  <!-- D — ORDER CANCELLATION -->
  <div class="section-divider"><span style="font-size:18px;">❌</span><div><div class="sd-title">D — Order Cancellation (Void Request)</div><div class="sd-sub">Module 2 · All Roles</div></div></div>
  <div class="page-card">
    <div class="page-card-header"><div><div class="page-name">D — Order Cancellation · User Stories</div><div class="page-sub">Two-step approval — Sales requests, Manager approves</div></div><span class="badge b-mod2">Module 2</span></div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="col">
        <div class="section-label">Why two steps?</div>
        <ul class="features">
          <li>A Sales staff <strong>cannot cancel a confirmed order directly</strong></li>
          <li>Prevents accidental or unauthorized cancellations</li>
          <li>Creates a full audit trail — every cancellation has a reason and a reviewer</li>
          <li>Prevents stock releasing back to elInventory without manager awareness</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="section-label">The Void Flow</div>
        <ul class="features">
          <li><strong>Sales:</strong> Opens order → Request Void → adds reason → submits</li>
          <li>Status changes to <em>Void Pending</em></li>
          <li><strong>Manager:</strong> Receives notification → reviews in Void Approvals queue</li>
          <li><strong>Approved:</strong> order → Voided; stock released in elInventory</li>
          <li><strong>Rejected:</strong> order stays active; Sales is notified</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-full">
